# Build context for the container images.
#
# The release stage copies the source tree, so keep everything that is not
# source out of it: VCS metadata, agent memory, the compiled binary and build
# output. A clean `git archive` therefore builds the same image as a working
# tree.
.git
.github
.clinerules
memory-bank
gputop
bin/
dist/
*.test
*.out
